      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think it should also more for how many friends you made. This will simulate more to do nothing wrong in vrchat. If you does wrong things in vrchat and others don't like you, you cannot make friends.\n\nIt should boost up your rank. But even i am making more friends, 3 pieces is just way too low. I need at least 5 slots, it sucks harder and harder because there are pretty much nice avatars. Sure i can favorite the avatar world but that is swap to world, get avatar and then back. That will just raise server work (downloading worlds) more.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
