      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still find it funny, avatar stealing became a feature aside from you only being able to save public avatars. kinda cut into avatar makers profits. but I don't really see why people would need more than 3 or even 1 at all. you can have well over 100 different personal avatars so why not seek the content for your own account as opposed to using stuff found in worlds?",
