      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I wouldn't base it on rank (though would accept that if no other choice). It's a game of creativity and social engagement - why would they not realize that COLLECTING AVATARS and their accoutrement is a big part of enjoyment? \n\nI'd personally like to see the limit set like favorites - you can have up to 32, and an option to \"upgrade\" for more if you're a 'collector'.",
